# Host-local state. Never commit.
.env
.last-good
.blocked
.update.lock
.env.generated

# Belt and suspenders for the age private key. The root .gitignore's
# `Actual-*` rule happened to also catch a file literally named
# actual-backup-key.txt, but only by coincidence of that name starting with
# "actual" — an unrelated pattern meant to exclude Electron build artifacts is
# not a real guarantee, and would not have caught e.g. financas-key.txt. The
# real fix is generating the key outside the repo in the first place (see
# docs/DEPLOY.md stage 7, which now does $HOME, not this directory); this rule
# is just a deliberate backstop in case that ever happens again.
*-backup-key.txt
*.age.key
